0..68 Comment "//! `forced` has a parent ask its task before it receives the reply."
69..72 Comment "//!"
73..203 Comment "//! The parent\'s send, the task\'s receipt and the task\'s reply form a chain. Only the task close commutes with the parent receipt."
204..207 Comment "//!"
208..322 Comment "//! The annotations state the channel web. The parent forks the task, sends a request, reads the reply and closes."
323..326 Comment "//!"
327..407 Comment "//! - see: `independent.gandr` — two tasks whose plays do not order each other"
408..484 Comment "//! - see: #3338 — the run trace and the web a source states for a channel"
